shape, each with two methods to write, its tests given, the plan seeded in
mem with the task and its shapes parallel. Run with GNOVM_SCENARIO_PEERS=1
for one session and 3 for three sessions at once in the project; both must
end with every test passing, the tests untouched and every todo done.

